{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "9afc24fc6f9b2f67c071ab057ebe83b8ce825fb417813ce132daf6123fc31028",
  "bundle_request_count": 32,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:07290a9721970dd0f64f900f2f8bf0d64c89677c7760d68c4ad811853f316107",
      "request_id": "07290a9721970dd0f64f900f2f8bf0d64c89677c7760d68c4ad811853f316107",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "da7e9656836efd7883f3819e17fb085a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "10 月 22 日，他在家乡布鲁塞尔，打完了职业生涯的最后一场。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9ef67ee969b5bc00e369b980dee2cd3f7c4e5c6c074bc09be41f518922e45e62",
      "words_sha256": "368d4d2e393ec44942fd1ed3e783fa6ed881b1534ba356b9b1c76dcbb4215897"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:0cdb0d9a53bee61322042aef574f36b0f4a6e508cfa4145e8a541767784ea8cd",
      "request_id": "0cdb0d9a53bee61322042aef574f36b0f4a6e508cfa4145e8a541767784ea8cd",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "aa35b0aec51b4dd25ac28a021e09ca9a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2025 年迈阿密，34 岁，他又一次逆转阿尔卡拉斯。阿尔卡拉斯后来承认，他上一次为网球掉眼泪，就是那年在迈阿密输给戈芬之后。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7b3c04a54a848da10e6d11d1dbce822edd9a46a88a7fbe94ba62eba6a305583c",
      "words_sha256": "0ad4bee5fab6afcc1f2b935b4fa8f3fed9fab4ba81bfcb47039dd052a46ed457"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:0eeb87d38e2a4705203ccd9082a83760ac6706b0404547d771dd6ad779b7f6ad",
      "request_id": "0eeb87d38e2a4705203ccd9082a83760ac6706b0404547d771dd6ad779b7f6ad",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1071aa21e711a21d78a510a546ffb622",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "没有大满贯、没有大师赛冠军，最高只到第 7——这样的职业生涯，算不算成功？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9a91c98f2f2a87f9a3dac7844f56951e79458a4903ef737c1b6046c7d8670d8e",
      "words_sha256": "b2cd816bb1a537111f557b9b76a7e3ea0e9142c101a0610d2fedf71cf8212278"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:21ada9d2f45fc93d1aff7c133557129cb3cca35334933e6427b9fe3e6a74373e",
      "request_id": "21ada9d2f45fc93d1aff7c133557129cb3cca35334933e6427b9fe3e6a74373e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "97d67eefca1aeb1372c764525b08de26",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2017 年，他还把比利时带进戴维斯杯决赛，两场单打全赢，球队还是输了。离冠军差一步——这件事，后来反复发生。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "819cf73ff3b8b623457a19ae8dee93508663c46ea900dec39e5f9c28002161a6",
      "words_sha256": "20bd075167314b29281989f8ac820f33c0aabd1fd6006b663805d30537e941cb"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:274f989bf574ac293b29efd09e2d0cd8d6cab0ede73bd9d4512dba9720edea6b",
      "request_id": "274f989bf574ac293b29efd09e2d0cd8d6cab0ede73bd9d4512dba9720edea6b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "490d60922b1e0045e654d08f27e0df48",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2026 年，膝伤让他决定停下，告别站选在家乡布鲁塞尔。首轮决胜盘 0 比 3 落后，他又抢了回来，赛后还开玩笑：订好的告别派对，怕是要取消了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "58dcaf569770113c0986d56ac2be14f9455c30e00b9b3546bb0d0414760e0756",
      "words_sha256": "fa52d974d03c6bbbe41d5a2345026f480831183b1b065ed50ea8ac184978e656"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2c8bff3942ebe03bda108d2d73c03f5651b8af8460a6b6e340257630579e2d1d",
      "request_id": "2c8bff3942ebe03bda108d2d73c03f5651b8af8460a6b6e340257630579e2d1d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bc45368e512fb0c965b86128b48f17a0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同一年，他接连赢下三巨头。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4b3c198496f84930cdd79b7a65037a7eb0dae04c66ba567256a0807cc9d8ca89",
      "words_sha256": "cfde44ff395c217c6992bd39fb35a2ba3398b9f3af2b6ede2058af7ca3e26343"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2db16ce28a40d9b1858cd46df61fc39bcb8b249b08011feb49da3066038f19c5",
      "request_id": "2db16ce28a40d9b1858cd46df61fc39bcb8b249b08011feb49da3066038f19c5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f9ccc718be34a182de279767d7707166",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2024 年上海，33 岁的他赢下兹维列夫，打进八强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c3eeed97fd1e057a423d97ae20f247456c436f529ca91829a58316e5606a2e1a",
      "words_sha256": "dd3f9dcd2f98a6b808253072a78863fb120cc1c9f6f3db3948638f5144f0b590"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2fb73fecb039bd2b75d7ba9317ce386bdf8931e12d091da7a9b2fa07a4527ec2",
      "request_id": "2fb73fecb039bd2b75d7ba9317ce386bdf8931e12d091da7a9b2fa07a4527ec2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "82519a8d07e141deddd910b72eed4f93",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "但 2017 年剩下的部分，他全抢了回来。那年 4 月的蒙特卡洛，他对德约科维奇此前五战全败。这一次决胜盘 2 比 4 落后，他硬是翻了盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b00fd8989b38c3f70a59825405f6c6392fd86ae32d84ccd26843a5562a289257",
      "words_sha256": "21375a8e957a3be748ac0e5c46c436d870f141e37f46f6b7e75744cc5a565a23"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:30d33afe2b98144cc4eac9003e26ec79d9243ddda946905132b063a854089ccf",
      "request_id": "30d33afe2b98144cc4eac9003e26ec79d9243ddda946905132b063a854089ccf",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "462187218ed1888088ea029bb20cf7a0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "而他这一生，离最大的两个冠军都只差一场。2017 年总决赛决赛，他输给迪米特洛夫。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "fc99e39bde01387edb4a5177dd4bdc369624c806a409aa082658a48af69dfb11",
      "words_sha256": "e2f52128bcfe12288230d98107df4e03a5d8a34f57cdcd2f867447368a814711"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:32b1f32dedbec3f83ff72b644720e07f77f6876652273c5078c2a42067a12ca2",
      "request_id": "32b1f32dedbec3f83ff72b644720e07f77f6876652273c5078c2a42067a12ca2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "24c19b0810dfe80152cf48d4f478100d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "很多人以为，他就此沉寂了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b04231157f2cd336907ae80854ad35ea5cfa66272ba2d127dfca41bebe53e65c",
      "words_sha256": "b673f7f6c3dacb1e02731b1231848bad022c38760d788900d7eb7901eed1927e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:33e0af5fcf4e72da94827a679e163cc69db398e29be8f752f81ddfc79c2f49a2",
      "request_id": "33e0af5fcf4e72da94827a679e163cc69db398e29be8f752f81ddfc79c2f49a2",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "41879f448e192bef6ab973fb9fff7da7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后一站，他选在家乡。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "dfe67ed5b2ab6d3b2c62ed26cb18efed0348e2cff5694e02eb4e2088cc6729c8",
      "words_sha256": "df32b0e8b5ae49a374b8c8306cd494a43896d2262d47528f56a688063ae858e7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3604f91d211dbbdc57109b5011d25775e1e3c3333c2f15d85044417ba852afc5",
      "request_id": "3604f91d211dbbdc57109b5011d25775e1e3c3333c2f15d85044417ba852afc5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "194e695d82fd2553db53db34f4a62ad6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "11 月伦敦总决赛，小组赛他赢了世界第一纳达尔——那一场纳达尔膝伤缠身，赛后退出了比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "45310dd9ce6767cf70ddf91e9d6e39f3b9e5265bb379b3b849c5402762840c94",
      "words_sha256": "73caa8efc81ba1d536eeb01053bbe3e46634a06b925e10b79548c055a812bc95"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3b212b651fb3393d79605bc3b079e98f6fca3b9daed632d49bb06c0f7b4242d7",
      "request_id": "3b212b651fb3393d79605bc3b079e98f6fca3b9daed632d49bb06c0f7b4242d7",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "64cec1b5c30bb0c4e4edc0caaf5b9bd4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "在同一站比赛里，先后击败纳达尔和费德勒——ATP 有一份官方名单，做到过的人一共只有六个：达维登科、德尔波特罗、德约科维奇、穆雷、纳班迪安。最后一个，是大卫·戈芬。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "24ade14fccc7b17f58adfda92350c89afce808af97179c0351e3d0b9d7ab0544",
      "words_sha256": "2f52d137524ba0eeec2440a9770221e8fcd7e3aef521d1c4fccfd2cb45159fbc"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3d17087fd9de14cfebef8456beb9014346f11b5f06e2c0c64a5f419c72ffc871",
      "request_id": "3d17087fd9de14cfebef8456beb9014346f11b5f06e2c0c64a5f419c72ffc871",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "191eab977773a00f1b3175265cdb514b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "故事从一个递补名额开始。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "da096446da98fb2bfad54f5499ded0a2d88ee634d4487bdfd6706e3c36425384",
      "words_sha256": "a3e5a08ef2b9995d1f35299739c694f21731e9d6a2e9fe97372e54dcbe1241f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:404bc343edf644031f3e55ff726f53f2d0cb12e870286ba34cc505ee5bb47c2a",
      "request_id": "404bc343edf644031f3e55ff726f53f2d0cb12e870286ba34cc505ee5bb47c2a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ba06ddcf97baac83fb2365c10e23207f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "故事没有在 2017 年结束。2020 年，他第二次赢下纳达尔。他说过，打拉法，你必须把球抢得更早、多冒险。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "876cd21d592144e7953b338f3c5cd7e523e7d30426975f873da02a723b86c2f7",
      "words_sha256": "de2f1a12e826639e307fb6d5258a5ea054ca35eb5da6e64956bf61b4a33b64d3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:40a81d83509bd0206fac2d62674301da2d227d376835bf05ed7387143c78df54",
      "request_id": "40a81d83509bd0206fac2d62674301da2d227d376835bf05ed7387143c78df54",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "040652253e833e123514390b0c8393bf",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同一句话，同一年，他说了两次。这一年，他把德约科维奇、纳达尔、费德勒挨个赢了一遍。同一年里通杀三巨头，整个三巨头时代，也没几个人做到过。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e65cfb8e9bed97e648ded170c20343dc66ebb345e4507e03b0aee89e8cfb86be",
      "words_sha256": "5e19f724700edf62dd28633935ed53f63eeeeced251bd748c9c6571f0676cfef"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4db4763797f5d8263f9dee4d0220c96d6217b3147e7722c2e786d69071506a61",
      "request_id": "4db4763797f5d8263f9dee4d0220c96d6217b3147e7722c2e786d69071506a61",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "abc71609fc33e209b0b88e22ec58f6f5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二天，最后一场，他输了。最后一个回球下网，全场起立。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1aff80ec2a69d09b3e02020bd7401e86ae1c335648f286f4741cf41e9d2f4270",
      "words_sha256": "87f14d23bbeeb155861ff881928dcd0fc7171917d0fc0f45ef7874560bb60f39"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4fe747dd06638f3ce7ea0b87e05444e815457191869ddc246bcfbe98b1d7d673",
      "request_id": "4fe747dd06638f3ce7ea0b87e05444e815457191869ddc246bcfbe98b1d7d673",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b4b1758e3acbb98ac7da77fa4fa7612c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2012 年法网，21 岁的戈芬排名第 109，资格赛已经出局。孟菲尔斯退赛，他以幸运落败者的身份递补进正赛——连赢三轮，第四轮站到了费德勒对面。他的卧室墙上，贴满了费德勒的海报。那一天，他从偶像手里抢下第一盘，第二盘只差两分，就能取得两盘领先。他的个子，在男子网球里不占优势。他靠的是抢点：站进场内，把球打得比所有人早半步。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c0b7e24df291beb7110080595651b37f484a352c69245324d6451b76c1184dae",
      "words_sha256": "f282496af34eea53b372e023fce396b305ec29455a407e69f15ca1a41b610122"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:52d3724f6a05dc8b969181f985e265f2641f46e0758bf92fe42cd132ce916ac4",
      "request_id": "52d3724f6a05dc8b969181f985e265f2641f46e0758bf92fe42cd132ce916ac4",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3429dafd55fccc37255c147966d75db2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这样的生涯，算成功吗？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5975f14ce54aa5945d897fd10a4835b4fdb1a2ed03becfa489d8fb6dc8a218d6",
      "words_sha256": "3fc0b7d36c132bb5b68ba48e24dc67608c40ab41f06da868ae58c23ab51f3513"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:56a98046a382d7258a3a73b5f91da1e42c8311f19d5780304669a92dcb6c6b4a",
      "request_id": "56a98046a382d7258a3a73b5f91da1e42c8311f19d5780304669a92dcb6c6b4a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bd655b16ee9cc12cf95e3bb2ce2fc46a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2022 年阿斯塔纳，资格赛出局的他，又以幸运落败者的身份递补进正赛，对面是刚拿下美网、刚登上世界第一的阿尔卡拉斯——他直落两盘赢了。两次从替补席出发，中间隔了整整十年。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c21ba9cc87136627efa0ff6d28a3d02796aac5314463fe0004f860031995ae19",
      "words_sha256": "a612297eb54c24716d4c163f1f8a0465d5aefbca802d6d1129cc68ee4725d548"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:68bbd2478625f75ec64793379c800c72fa92744d5b53194927e9a15df6a31ff0",
      "request_id": "68bbd2478625f75ec64793379c800c72fa92744d5b53194927e9a15df6a31ff0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e37068973f1a1ce5a5360bc7d93348e2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "大屏幕上，纳达尔第一个出现，祝贺他了不起的职业生涯。他站在场中央，哭了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
