        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第五个赛点，终于兑现。他说：这是我生涯最佳的一场胜利。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "10ba6542e4ae4b1be2604fb539e719790c27a1b52f3b956ac5a80c6e3468e8b3",
      "words_sha256": "4eddf068413173c324672e2614bcd567b5e7ff5c098d6df7e3feceeae49c902a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f8a7de5757c4f8d054a24f0ef567dafc4e700bec5194c6d2fbaecf2288a0e81d",
      "request_id": "f8a7de5757c4f8d054a24f0ef567dafc4e700bec5194c6d2fbaecf2288a0e81d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b7c16652eabf4f756bb9e311b2929dae",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛，他又逆转了费德勒——此前六次交手，他全败。他说：这是我生涯最佳的一场胜利，千真万确。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
