        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2019 年辛辛那提，他唯一一次大师赛决赛，输给梅德韦杰夫。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "4b3c198496f84930cdd79b7a65037a7eb0dae04c66ba567256a0807cc9d8ca89",
      "words_sha256": "cfde44ff395c217c6992bd39fb35a2ba3398b9f3af2b6ede2058af7ca3e26343",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bc45368e512fb0c965b86128b48f17a0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同一年，他接连赢下三巨头。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b00fd8989b38c3f70a59825405f6c6392fd86ae32d84ccd26843a5562a289257",
      "words_sha256": "21375a8e957a3be748ac0e5c46c436d870f141e37f46f6b7e75744cc5a565a23",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "82519a8d07e141deddd910b72eed4f93",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "但 2017 年剩下的部分，他全抢了回来。那年 4 月的蒙特卡洛，他对德约科维奇此前五战全败。这一次决胜盘 2 比 4 落后，他硬是翻了盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "10ba6542e4ae4b1be2604fb539e719790c27a1b52f3b956ac5a80c6e3468e8b3",
      "words_sha256": "4eddf068413173c324672e2614bcd567b5e7ff5c098d6df7e3feceeae49c902a",
      "words_path": "voice_16.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9efb619029c47f7a1c0f762570daa10f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第五个赛点，终于兑现。他说：这是我生涯最佳的一场胜利。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "45310dd9ce6767cf70ddf91e9d6e39f3b9e5265bb379b3b849c5402762840c94",
      "words_sha256": "73caa8efc81ba1d536eeb01053bbe3e46634a06b925e10b79548c055a812bc95",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "194e695d82fd2553db53db34f4a62ad6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "11 月伦敦总决赛，小组赛他赢了世界第一纳达尔——那一场纳达尔膝伤缠身，赛后退出了比赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "cf17ec76703c22a0fbcaafc4d4eaf8d54ff33d670b0742604d5cf344bf5883a3",
      "words_sha256": "a2cbf0092be691253147051af557ac0cfa2b61fba989eb301f5b9248ce2cff98",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b7c16652eabf4f756bb9e311b2929dae",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "半决赛，他又逆转了费德勒——此前六次交手，他全败。他说：这是我生涯最佳的一场胜利，千真万确。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e65cfb8e9bed97e648ded170c20343dc66ebb345e4507e03b0aee89e8cfb86be",
      "words_sha256": "5e19f724700edf62dd28633935ed53f63eeeeced251bd748c9c6571f0676cfef",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "040652253e833e123514390b0c8393bf",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同一句话，同一年，他说了两次。这一年，他把德约科维奇、纳达尔、费德勒挨个赢了一遍。同一年里通杀三巨头，整个三巨头时代，也没几个人做到过。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b04231157f2cd336907ae80854ad35ea5cfa66272ba2d127dfca41bebe53e65c",
      "words_sha256": "b673f7f6c3dacb1e02731b1231848bad022c38760d788900d7eb7901eed1927e",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "24c19b0810dfe80152cf48d4f478100d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "很多人以为，他就此沉寂了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "876cd21d592144e7953b338f3c5cd7e523e7d30426975f873da02a723b86c2f7",
      "words_sha256": "de2f1a12e826639e307fb6d5258a5ea054ca35eb5da6e64956bf61b4a33b64d3",
      "words_path": "voice_23.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ba06ddcf97baac83fb2365c10e23207f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "故事没有在 2017 年结束。2020 年，他第二次赢下纳达尔。他说过，打拉法，你必须把球抢得更早、多冒险。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c21ba9cc87136627efa0ff6d28a3d02796aac5314463fe0004f860031995ae19",
      "words_sha256": "a612297eb54c24716d4c163f1f8a0465d5aefbca802d6d1129cc68ee4725d548",
      "words_path": "voice_24.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bd655b16ee9cc12cf95e3bb2ce2fc46a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2022 年阿斯塔纳，资格赛出局的他，又以幸运落败者的身份递补进正赛，对面是刚拿下美网、刚登上世界第一的阿尔卡拉斯——他直落两盘赢了。两次从替补席出发，中间隔了整整十年。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c3eeed97fd1e057a423d97ae20f247456c436f529ca91829a58316e5606a2e1a",
      "words_sha256": "dd3f9dcd2f98a6b808253072a78863fb120cc1c9f6f3db3948638f5144f0b590",
      "words_path": "voice_26.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f9ccc718be34a182de279767d7707166",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2024 年上海，33 岁的他赢下兹维列夫，打进八强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7b3c04a54a848da10e6d11d1dbce822edd9a46a88a7fbe94ba62eba6a305583c",
      "words_sha256": "0ad4bee5fab6afcc1f2b935b4fa8f3fed9fab4ba81bfcb47039dd052a46ed457",
      "words_path": "voice_27.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "aa35b0aec51b4dd25ac28a021e09ca9a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2025 年迈阿密，34 岁，他又一次逆转阿尔卡拉斯。阿尔卡拉斯后来承认，他上一次为网球掉眼泪，就是那年在迈阿密输给戈芬之后。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "dfe67ed5b2ab6d3b2c62ed26cb18efed0348e2cff5694e02eb4e2088cc6729c8",
      "words_sha256": "df32b0e8b5ae49a374b8c8306cd494a43896d2262d47528f56a688063ae858e7",
      "words_path": "voice_28.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "41879f448e192bef6ab973fb9fff7da7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后一站，他选在家乡。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "58dcaf569770113c0986d56ac2be14f9455c30e00b9b3546bb0d0414760e0756",
      "words_sha256": "fa52d974d03c6bbbe41d5a2345026f480831183b1b065ed50ea8ac184978e656",
      "words_path": "voice_29.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "490d60922b1e0045e654d08f27e0df48",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "2026 年，膝伤让他决定停下，告别站选在家乡布鲁塞尔。首轮决胜盘 0 比 3 落后，他又抢了回来，赛后还开玩笑：订好的告别派对，怕是要取消了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1aff80ec2a69d09b3e02020bd7401e86ae1c335648f286f4741cf41e9d2f4270",
      "words_sha256": "87f14d23bbeeb155861ff881928dcd0fc7171917d0fc0f45ef7874560bb60f39",
      "words_path": "voice_30.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "abc71609fc33e209b0b88e22ec58f6f5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二天，最后一场，他输了。最后一个回球下网，全场起立。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "48f203bf903ea00f92b759f55397889c76d13784a1c34e52bb7a124ef00be9ac",
      "words_sha256": "7f7fbb40be733e2542570b0920d6b67f7c9f58deef023eff6d18a7bb08d6ebf1",
      "words_path": "voice_31.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e37068973f1a1ce5a5360bc7d93348e2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "大屏幕上，纳达尔第一个出现，祝贺他了不起的职业生涯。他站在场中央，哭了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c054a79c5828e07a7d7a906dd909fff75e6b7c4282127afb1c551ea6eafa907c",
      "words_sha256": "7b5d46f1759c2ec6fe7850f68d3851ec166847def79923d9df7749dea00ca2b9",
      "words_path": "voice_33.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ad473d3e1696583677c87436a71dfd32",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "358 场胜利，6 个冠军。他在赛后说：我为我的整个职业生涯自豪，我没有遗憾，我拼到了最后一刻。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9a91c98f2f2a87f9a3dac7844f56951e79458a4903ef737c1b6046c7d8670d8e",
      "words_sha256": "b2cd816bb1a537111f557b9b76a7e3ea0e9142c101a0610d2fedf71cf8212278",
      "words_path": "voice_35.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1071aa21e711a21d78a510a546ffb622",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "没有大满贯、没有大师赛冠军，最高只到第 7——这样的职业生涯，算不算成功？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5975f14ce54aa5945d897fd10a4835b4fdb1a2ed03becfa489d8fb6dc8a218d6",
      "words_sha256": "3fc0b7d36c132bb5b68ba48e24dc67608c40ab41f06da868ae58c23ab51f3513",
      "words_path": "voice_36.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "3429dafd55fccc37255c147966d75db2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这样的生涯，算成功吗？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c13d8964c9a3228cd11608bac363c233e8e4b2743fe6f0ee692e8eacb04aaccf",
      "words_sha256": "10151f58046b6d2257c692124f9f9a9d8ee7a4375776e0f49af07dac5280e898",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "66a14aaa855de1f8263878d4284206de",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三巨头，他都赢过；大满贯，他一个没有。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "89197b3d78d82f61c86c39df76885a5f13b8afb39731b2f251f971874bed5c49",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    }
  ]
}
